      ],
      "text": "Introduction",
      "font": "SegoeUI",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        180.91859436035156,
        524.5953979492188,
        195.36158752441406
      ],
      "text": "Tuberculosis (TB) strains that are resistant to TB medicines are more difficult to treat than drug-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.1186065673828,
        527.3859252929688,
        208.5615997314453
      ],
      "text": "susceptible ones, and present a major challenge for patients, health care workers and health care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.31861877441406,
        527.4003295898438,
        221.76161193847656
      ],
      "text": "services. In addition, the increase of drug-resistant TB (DR-TB) threatens global progress towards the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        219.2426300048828,
        527.504150390625,
        234.9616241455078
      ],
      "text": "(1) targets set by the End TB Strategy   of the World Health Organization (WHO). Thus, there is a critical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.983137130737305,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        233.71864318847656,
        527.4398193359375,
        248.16163635253906
      ],
      "text": "need for the continual development of evidence-based policy recommendations on the treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        246.91859436035156,
        524.4071655273438,
        261.3616027832031
      ],
      "text": "and care of patients with DR-TB, based on the most recent and comprehensive evidence available.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        268.62261962890625,
        527.5780639648438,
        283.0656433105469
      ],
      "text": "In the past decade, WHO has developed and issued evidence-based policy recommendations for the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983687400817871,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        281.7125244140625,
        527.4269409179688,
        296.2655334472656
      ],
